WEBVTT

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.060
<v Buyer>How did you get my number?

00:00:04.482 --> 00:00:07.367
<v Caller>I found it in your company’s public staff directory.

00:00:07.798 --> 00:00:10.399
<v Buyer>Thanks. Please take me off your list.

00:00:10.826 --> 00:00:14.284
<v Caller>Understood. I’ll record your request and stop here.
